WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.217
- I don't know why I can't
retain like anything about

00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:04.008
like elementary school,
but for some reason I can

00:00:04.008 --> 00:00:06.232
remember all the details
about Rugrats. (laughing)

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:08.815
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.674 --> 00:00:14.749
We are bringing our childhood
dreams to life today.

00:00:14.749 --> 00:00:15.892
We are trying--

00:00:15.892 --> 00:00:18.255
- [Together] Reptar Bars!

00:00:18.255 --> 00:00:21.517
- This was the favorite candy
of The Rugrats' children.

00:00:21.517 --> 00:00:23.796
- It is the candy of
my youth, that I wanted

00:00:23.796 --> 00:00:24.822
more than anything else.

00:00:24.822 --> 00:00:26.086
- Halt, I am Reptar.

00:00:26.086 --> 00:00:28.158
- [Together] Halt, I am Reptar.

00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:29.719
Halt, I am Reptar.

00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:30.696
- Rugrats?

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:31.529
- Oh.

00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:32.362
- It was so good.

00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:33.195
- Oh, classic.

00:00:33.195 --> 00:00:35.457
- And I still watch
clips on YouTube and cry.

00:00:35.457 --> 00:00:37.032
- I was obsessed with Reptar.

00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:39.002
I knew all the episodes with it in it.

00:00:39.002 --> 00:00:40.316
And I thought he was a real thing!

00:00:40.316 --> 00:00:43.386
- (singing) Gotta stinky
diaper your still the

00:00:43.386 --> 00:00:46.136
little brother that I prayed for.

00:00:47.616 --> 00:00:50.033
I guess you make me love you.

00:00:51.529 --> 00:00:52.384
Shit, man.

00:00:52.384 --> 00:00:55.034
- I don't know it was a, it
was a very sentimental moment.

00:00:55.034 --> 00:00:56.051
Now what, do you--

00:00:56.051 --> 00:00:56.884
- I'm okay.

00:00:56.884 --> 00:00:58.218
I'm okay.

00:00:58.218 --> 00:01:00.269
- Bring on the chocolate bars.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:01.444
- Yes.

00:01:01.444 --> 00:01:02.287
- Wow, aw shit.

00:01:02.287 --> 00:01:03.120
- It's real.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.953
- Wow!

00:01:03.953 --> 00:01:05.265
Does it really turn your tongue green?

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.248
It says it does!

00:01:06.248 --> 00:01:07.615
- It says it turns your tongue green.

00:01:07.615 --> 00:01:08.768
- It has instructions.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:09.601
Tear open.

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:10.718
- Step two: chomp.

00:01:10.718 --> 00:01:12.818
- And step three is roar
like Reptar (laughing).

00:01:12.818 --> 00:01:14.235
- [Together] Ahh!

00:01:15.156 --> 00:01:16.421
- Oh wow!

00:01:16.421 --> 00:01:17.480
- Oh my God!

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:18.702
- [Woman 1] She's beautiful.

00:01:18.702 --> 00:01:19.535
- Look at this.

00:01:19.535 --> 00:01:20.963
- [Woman 1] Uh!

00:01:20.963 --> 00:01:21.907
- Oh!

00:01:21.907 --> 00:01:23.004
- It is good.

00:01:23.004 --> 00:01:23.837
- Mm hmm.

00:01:23.837 --> 00:01:24.890
- It's really good.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:26.789
- I was expecting it to be
sweet, but that is somehow

00:01:26.789 --> 00:01:29.120
sweeter than what candy already is.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.098
- Need a moment?

00:01:30.098 --> 00:01:30.931
- Mmm

00:01:32.966 --> 00:01:34.696
- Oh, look at that squish out.

00:01:34.696 --> 00:01:35.529
- Mmm hmm.

00:01:35.529 --> 00:01:36.589
I was expecting a little bit more, like,

00:01:36.589 --> 00:01:37.688
detailing on the chocolate.

00:01:37.688 --> 00:01:40.026
In the cartoon the bar was
actually shaped like Reptar.

00:01:40.026 --> 00:01:41.934
- The frosting tastes better
than I thought it would.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:42.767
- Dude.

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:43.859
- I don't like frosting much.

00:01:43.859 --> 00:01:44.692
I've always thought it kinda gross.

00:01:44.692 --> 00:01:45.843
- I love frosting.

00:01:45.843 --> 00:01:46.690
- Uh

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:48.249
- It's a little green.

00:01:48.249 --> 00:01:49.082
- I think--

00:01:49.082 --> 00:01:50.599
- Not as green as I want it to be.

00:01:50.599 --> 00:01:52.519
- It's a real like sewage green.

00:01:52.519 --> 00:01:54.239
It's like a very brown hue to it.

00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:56.601
- Yeah, yours is mostly
a sewage green too.

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.805
Ah I was really hoping the
whole of my tongue would

00:01:58.805 --> 00:02:01.251
stick out of my face and
then be like the mask--

00:02:01.251 --> 00:02:02.084
- Yeah

00:02:02.084 --> 00:02:02.917
- Green.

00:02:02.917 --> 00:02:03.750
Like Jim Carrey green.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.132
- Ooh it's getting there
I think you need to like

00:02:05.132 --> 00:02:06.632
lick the toxicity.

00:02:07.551 --> 00:02:10.565
= [Both] (roaring)

00:02:10.565 --> 00:02:11.950
- Tastes like chocolate.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:13.129
- It tastes like chocolate.

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:13.978
- It's good--

00:02:13.978 --> 00:02:14.811
- It's--

00:02:14.811 --> 00:02:16.419
- I think I would rather have
it for the novelty of it.

00:02:16.419 --> 00:02:18.199
Like I'd rather have the full
one to just put on my shelf

00:02:18.199 --> 00:02:20.174
to like impress men that
come and sleep over.

00:02:20.174 --> 00:02:21.812
Be like here's my Harry Potter collection,

00:02:21.812 --> 00:02:22.992
here's my Reptar Bar.

00:02:22.992 --> 00:02:23.831
- Look how cool I am.

00:02:23.831 --> 00:02:24.674
- Yeah.

00:02:24.674 --> 00:02:25.781
- Nostalgia's so real.

00:02:25.781 --> 00:02:26.614
- Yeah.

00:02:26.614 --> 00:02:28.043
- Like no matter who you are.

00:02:28.043 --> 00:02:29.127
We've only met a couple months ago--

00:02:29.127 --> 00:02:29.960
- Mmm

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.149
- Completely different
childhoods, different parts

00:02:32.149 --> 00:02:34.393
of the world, but we love the Rugrats.

00:02:34.393 --> 00:02:36.146
- It is stuff like this,
no matter what's going on

00:02:36.146 --> 00:02:38.424
in the world, stuff like this
can bring people together.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.987
- Yeah, I'm glad we got to have this.

00:02:39.987 --> 00:02:41.696
It's something I definitely
dreamed about wanting

00:02:41.696 --> 00:02:43.484
all the time when I was
a kid and even though

00:02:43.484 --> 00:02:46.143
eating it now, like, it's just candy.

00:02:46.143 --> 00:02:49.692
- This is more about the
idea of like, dreaming about

00:02:49.692 --> 00:02:51.982
something as a kid and then
in whatever form that takes

00:02:51.982 --> 00:02:53.535
it becomes real.

00:02:53.535 --> 00:02:55.252
I feel like there's a
little bit of magic to it.

00:02:55.252 --> 00:02:56.273
It's a little magical.

00:02:56.273 --> 00:02:57.469
- [Together] Halt, I am Reptar.

00:02:57.469 --> 00:02:59.067
Halt, I am Reptar.

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:00.550
- You just do this throughout the trailer.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:01.822
- Halt, I am Reptar.

00:03:01.822 --> 00:03:02.655
- Halt.

00:03:02.655 --> 00:03:03.586
- Subscribe cards come over us.

00:03:03.586 --> 00:03:04.604
Halt, I am Reptar.

00:03:04.604 --> 00:03:05.502
- Halt.

